 <h3><u>Abbas ka parcham</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Kare fauje khuda abbas ka parcham<br> Shuja’aane arab ka silsila abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Waqare az mohammad hausla abbas ka parcham<br> Sikhata hai ita’at aur wafa abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Siyahi deene haq ke aur aayate ilaahi hai<br> shabeehe zuljana ho taziya abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Wo kya nemat hai jo iske tasadduk hum nahi paate<br> bataye kya tumhe deta hai kya abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Mohafiz hai do aalam me azadarane sarwar ke<br> Reza e haq duae sayyada abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Hai hamza jafar o haider ki yaadein isse wabasta<br> inhi hazraat ki meeraas tha abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Lewail hamd ke manind misle daware zehra<br> khuda ka qurb karta hai ata abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Jahane rang o bu me qabr me barzakh me mehshar me<br> sahara hai hamara aapka abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Mera dawa hai tumse mushkile khud bachke niklegi<br> tasawwur me rakho subho masaa abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Chhuda lete hai humko sibte jafar har musibat se<br> dua khake shifa farshe azaa abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Yehi tha dashte ghurbat me, anise zainab o sarwar<br> sakina aur haram ka aasra abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Rahegi chadare sar par bujhegi pyaas baccho ki<br> dilasa subh tak deta raha abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Qamar tuti Husain ibne ali ki aas bacho ki<br> qareebe asr jab thanda hua abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Lagae ab bhi seene se hai mashkeeza sakina ka<br> bohot ghamgee hai baade karbala abbas ka parcham<br> <br> Majalis me julooso me azakhano me zindaa me<br> Sakina ko hai ab bhi dhundhta abbas ka parcham</p> 
